# Single backend architecture

Node.js Express is the **only** backend. There is no Dart mirror.

## Same PR checklist (when changing routes)

- [ ] Route path + HTTP method
- [ ] Auth / role guards
- [ ] Request body validation
- [ ] Response JSON shape
- [ ] Status codes
- [ ] Calendar date fields (`YYYY-MM-DD` via `calendarDate.js`)

## CI

- Jest tests on `server/routes/*.js` run in CI — keep Node routes covered.
